{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/24f356da9ef4b8898ad526b51eb1781b.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underground: World War</strong> is a fighting game inspired by the Def Jam series. You can create your own fighter or play as some of your favorite rappers in this over the top fighting game. Fighters can be fully customized and choose from multiple fighting styles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/cbefed00de7f3962904c906fc0fabdd9.poster.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/cbefed00de7f3962904c906fc0fabdd9.webm?t=1757340700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/cbefed00de7f3962904c906fc0fabdd9.mp4?t=1757340700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLE MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go head-to-head in *1 vs 1* matches for a test of skill and strategy, team up for thrilling *2 vs 2* battles, or unleash chaos in *Free for All* fights where anything goes. Whether you prefer solo showdowns or chaotic multiplayer action, there\u2019s a mode for every fighter. Step into the arena and prove your dominance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/2ed6584990fd43541382bf87b8f3879a.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/11a1b5e0679e6329d6d10b0129e08c0c.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=254 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNDERGROUND RAPPERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can choose from a roster of underground rappers, each with unique styles and strengths. This lineup allows players to play as their favorite artists or experiment with various characters, bringing authenticity and diversity to the underground fighting scene.\u00a0Rappers have signature voice lines and taunts that bring personality to each fight, enhancing both character identity and player experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each underground rapper in the game has their own tracks featured within gameplay, adding an immersive layer as players fight to the sound of the artists\u2019 unique music. The game includes real-time audio visualization, lighting effects synched to the current playing beat, powerful ambient sounds, crowd reactions, and intense impact effects to heighten the atmosphere and realism.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WINNING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning requires a knockout or submission. Each fighting style has unique knockout methods: streetfighters with strong punches, wrestlers with strong grapples, kickboxers with kick-combos, martial artists with flying attacks and submission experts can force the enemy to submit with grapples.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARENA IMPACT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use environments and crowds for damage. Toss opponents into barriers and slam them into walls or gates. Crowds will push fighters back into combat, punch, or hold them leaving them open to attacks. Some spectators will offer weapons, and some might attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/036bf36bb31b5dcd4025d043d43366cb.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/bd2f1a255871b5a0ac5de405ebf74ab6.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=254 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WEAPONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fight isn't limited to fists and feet,\u00a0the streets fight dirty!\u00a0Grab pipes, bottles, bats, and more to turn the tide in brutal brawls. Whether you're smashing speakers or breaking bones, every weapon adds a new layer of chaos to the fight. Use your surroundings, strike hard, and leave your mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/850b95acea9b17862e94bb0b479ecfce.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=255 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/f166ff62205163a67d85555f4f0836f8.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=254 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RAGE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RAGE is gained by performing moves, countering, and taunting, influenced by the fighters' statistics, which varies between fighters. Created fighters can boost their statistics by upgrading skillset or wardrobe. A full RAGE meter allows enabling a powerful RAGE move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/5731ecacfdf4e41e8cb8e64b2acaef99.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/0bdd7b39ae359a123499765db21a4367.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=254 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE YOUR MALE OR FEMALE FIGHTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize every detail of your fighter, from facial features and body shape to a full wardrobe of unique gear. Build a look that suits your style and step into the fight with a character that's truly your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/1af27911b5bc77db537e30bd48ca821c.poster.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/1af27911b5bc77db537e30bd48ca821c.webm?t=1757340700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/1af27911b5bc77db537e30bd48ca821c.mp4?t=1757340700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHTING STYLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After creating your fighter, it's time to pick your fighting style. Each fighting style comes with its own unique strengths, combos, and finishing moves. Your choice defines how you fight, so pick wisely and prepare to conquer your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/63ceeedd60694cbfa9b720111ac8acbb.poster.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/63ceeedd60694cbfa9b720111ac8acbb.webm?t=1757340700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/63ceeedd60694cbfa9b720111ac8acbb.mp4?t=1757340700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VENUES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/003e70b89568aba16d5565b42349dc6c.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through the Underground Parking, where the environment is your weapon! Smash opponents into cars, slam them against pillars, and use the thundering speakers for devastating attacks. The crowd is wild, and some even bring weapons into the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/3bc0ad0c8953d2045f9f43e6e4cc996e.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=255 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle deep in the 135th Street Station, a dangerous subway arena where the environment can be your deadliest weapon! Slam opponents into pillars, walls, and fences, or send them crashing onto the train tracks. Time it right, and the incoming train will deliver an instant KO!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More venues, game modes, rappers, fighting styles, music and wardrobe content are added over time.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAYER ROSTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Check our website for the latest roster update</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2997970?t=1757340700","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757340700","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757340700","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757340700","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/24f356da9ef4b8898ad526b51eb1781b.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underground: World War</strong> is a fighting game inspired by the Def Jam series. You can create your own fighter or play as some of your favorite rappers in this over the top fighting game. Fighters can be fully customized and choose from multiple fighting styles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/cbefed00de7f3962904c906fc0fabdd9.poster.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/cbefed00de7f3962904c906fc0fabdd9.webm?t=1757340700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/cbefed00de7f3962904c906fc0fabdd9.mp4?t=1757340700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLE MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go head-to-head in *1 vs 1* matches for a test of skill and strategy, team up for thrilling *2 vs 2* battles, or unleash chaos in *Free for All* fights where anything goes. Whether you prefer solo showdowns or chaotic multiplayer action, there\u2019s a mode for every fighter. Step into the arena and prove your dominance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/2ed6584990fd43541382bf87b8f3879a.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/11a1b5e0679e6329d6d10b0129e08c0c.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=254 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNDERGROUND RAPPERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can choose from a roster of underground rappers, each with unique styles and strengths. This lineup allows players to play as their favorite artists or experiment with various characters, bringing authenticity and diversity to the underground fighting scene.\u00a0Rappers have signature voice lines and taunts that bring personality to each fight, enhancing both character identity and player experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each underground rapper in the game has their own tracks featured within gameplay, adding an immersive layer as players fight to the sound of the artists\u2019 unique music. The game includes real-time audio visualization, lighting effects synched to the current playing beat, powerful ambient sounds, crowd reactions, and intense impact effects to heighten the atmosphere and realism.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WINNING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning requires a knockout or submission. Each fighting style has unique knockout methods: streetfighters with strong punches, wrestlers with strong grapples, kickboxers with kick-combos, martial artists with flying attacks and submission experts can force the enemy to submit with grapples.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARENA IMPACT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use environments and crowds for damage. Toss opponents into barriers and slam them into walls or gates. Crowds will push fighters back into combat, punch, or hold them leaving them open to attacks. Some spectators will offer weapons, and some might attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/036bf36bb31b5dcd4025d043d43366cb.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/bd2f1a255871b5a0ac5de405ebf74ab6.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=254 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WEAPONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fight isn't limited to fists and feet,\u00a0the streets fight dirty!\u00a0Grab pipes, bottles, bats, and more to turn the tide in brutal brawls. Whether you're smashing speakers or breaking bones, every weapon adds a new layer of chaos to the fight. Use your surroundings, strike hard, and leave your mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/850b95acea9b17862e94bb0b479ecfce.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=255 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/f166ff62205163a67d85555f4f0836f8.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=254 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RAGE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RAGE is gained by performing moves, countering, and taunting, influenced by the fighters' statistics, which varies between fighters. Created fighters can boost their statistics by upgrading skillset or wardrobe. A full RAGE meter allows enabling a powerful RAGE move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/5731ecacfdf4e41e8cb8e64b2acaef99.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/0bdd7b39ae359a123499765db21a4367.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=254 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE YOUR MALE OR FEMALE FIGHTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize every detail of your fighter, from facial features and body shape to a full wardrobe of unique gear. Build a look that suits your style and step into the fight with a character that's truly your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/1af27911b5bc77db537e30bd48ca821c.poster.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/1af27911b5bc77db537e30bd48ca821c.webm?t=1757340700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/1af27911b5bc77db537e30bd48ca821c.mp4?t=1757340700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHTING STYLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After creating your fighter, it's time to pick your fighting style. Each fighting style comes with its own unique strengths, combos, and finishing moves. Your choice defines how you fight, so pick wisely and prepare to conquer your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/63ceeedd60694cbfa9b720111ac8acbb.poster.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/63ceeedd60694cbfa9b720111ac8acbb.webm?t=1757340700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/63ceeedd60694cbfa9b720111ac8acbb.mp4?t=1757340700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VENUES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/003e70b89568aba16d5565b42349dc6c.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through the Underground Parking, where the environment is your weapon! Smash opponents into cars, slam them against pillars, and use the thundering speakers for devastating attacks. The crowd is wild, and some even bring weapons into the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997970/extras/3bc0ad0c8953d2045f9f43e6e4cc996e.avif?t=1757340700\" width=600 height=255 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle deep in the 135th Street Station, a dangerous subway arena where the environment can be your deadliest weapon! Slam opponents into pillars, walls, and fences, or send them crashing onto the train tracks. Time it right, and the incoming train will deliver an instant KO!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More venues, game modes, rappers, fighting styles, music and wardrobe content are added over time.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAYER ROSTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Check our website for the latest roster update</i></p>","developers":["Underworld Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.ak